# diagnostic
# #95: fence mode's blank pointer is replaced by the authored anchor post and
# fence grid on the hovered grid point. Captures are for visual review only.
start freeform-map
click "construction"
click "Fence Tab"
select-catalogue "brickwall"
move 840 400
wait 30
capture fence-anchor-hover
wheel 3 3
wait 30
capture fence-anchor-hover-close
key ESCAPE
until placement_previews == 0
